1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,190
This castle is almost 500 years old.
据作者介绍，这座城堡差不多有五百年历史。

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,430
Let's see maybe it's blocked off or maybe it's just to keep the sheep out.
看看，也许这里封住了，也许只是为了把羊挡在外面。

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:38,390
Oh when you push this down you can move oh look at that oh.
噢，把这个按下去就能移动。噢，看那里。

4
00:00:38,400 --> 00:01:08,950
Stairs that went up the fireplace oh this is awesome.
曾经通往上面的楼梯……壁炉。噢，这太棒了。

5
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,400
This castle was destroyed in battle during the coveting wars around the 1700 s.
作者说，这座城堡在大约十八世纪一场战争中被毁，战争名字幕记为 coveting。

6
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:21,040
The mcdougall clan had this castle and uh they ended up having to surrender because of lack of water.
他说 McDougall 家族曾拥有这座城堡，但最终因缺水而不得不投降。

7
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:34,870
And they were promised if they surrendered they wouldn't be killed and they surrendered and then they just murdered everybody.
他们曾得到承诺，投降就不会被杀；结果投降之后，所有人还是被杀了。

8
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:51,750
I see red stuff yeah these windows.
我看到红色的东西。对，这些窗户。

9
00:01:51,760 --> 00:02:03,800
Absolutely gorgeous spot for a castle and you can see why it'd be so hard to defeat this thing you're not getting up these cliffs yep.
这位置对于城堡来说真是绝美，也能看出为什么它那么难攻下来：你很难爬上这些悬崖。

10
00:02:12,159 --> 00:02:22,709
Check out the walls with the the arrow slits and stuff yeah that would be dirty business trying to attack this castle.
看看墙上的箭孔之类的东西。是啊，想进攻这座城堡可是难办的事。

11
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:28,880
Would you like to go down to the beach and see if we can build a fire yeah all right maybe we can do some fishing too.
想不想到海滩去，看看能不能生个火？好。也许还能钓点鱼。

12
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:35,750
Come on let's do it no no there's plenty of poop down there you don't need to carry any poop.
来吧，走。别别，下面有很多羊粪，不用带羊粪走。

13
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:49,120
Well listen guys do you want to build a little campfire well uh what's there to burn is there any wood any trees.
听着，孩子们，你们想生一小堆篝火吗？嗯，有什么能烧的？有木头、有树吗？

14
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:55,110
Maybe we can burn the sheep like you could do with the buffalo poo.
也许可以烧羊……像烧野牛粪那样。

15
00:02:55,120 --> 00:03:00,960
I think maybe you're right you got you need the stuff that's super dry like see this oh that's gross.
我觉得也许你说得对。你要那种特别干的东西。像这个，看，噢，真恶心。

16
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:10,870
You you now that's not a dry one that's that's juicy see this see how this one's dry on the top it's a little wet on the bottom but it's dry on the top.
不，这个不干，还湿着。看，这个顶部干，底部有点湿，但上面是干的。

17
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:16,159
Let's collect some poop I'm not collecting come on you want to collect food do not.
我们来捡羊粪吧。我不捡。来呀，你想收集……食物，不要。

18
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:23,430
Jake make a poo pile but only the dry stuff see that's a wet one go get all the poops that are dry and put them there.
Jake，堆一小堆羊粪，只要干的。看，那是湿的。把那些干的捡过来，放那里。

19
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:30,159
See here see look at this do you know what this is this is dry kelp.
看看这里，看这个。你知道这是什么吗？这是干海带。

20
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:41,520
Here tommy make a big pile right here see you right there nice piece of wood I need your help on this.
Tommy，在这里堆一大堆。看，就在这。不错的木头。我需要你帮忙弄这个。
